    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d530-a4">

                <pb facs="0606" n="526" xml:id="pg526"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Extract.</hi></head>
                <p>At the moment of writing the information received is so scanty that it is
                    difficult for Mr. Chamberlain to state what form of assistance is most required,
                    but he is communicating the substance of Mr. Choate’s letter to the governor of
                    the Windward Islands by telegraph, and is requesting him to state what are the
                    most immediate needs.</p>
                <p>On the receipt of a reply he hopes to be in a position to take advantage of this
                    generous offer.</p>
                <p>In the meantime the governor of the Windward Islands, at St. Vincent, will gladly
                    receive and distribute any gifts sent to his care.</p>
            </div>
